INTRO = "Breathless from his taxi ride, Baek Seung-chan finally reaches the restaurant just as Youn Yuh-jung confronts Ra Joon-mo for sending a brand-new rookie in his place. Once the veteran actress leaves, Joon-mo turns all his frustration onto Seung-chan's roundabout speech. Listen to the Korean first, then we'll go through it together."
